    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Message outbox\nWebhook **ce-dispatch_outbound_message**.\n\n1. SMTP credential **CoreEngine SMTP** on both **Send email** nodes.\n2. Env: `BFF_URL`, `N8N_WEBHOOK_SECRET`, `CRM_N8N_*`, optional `SMTP_FROM`.\n3. Type **Email** → SMTP to `message.email`. Attaches **all** linked Message files (plus generated PDF when Opportunity + template env).\n4. Other types still stub → Mark sent.\n5. Error workflow → failed-execution-alert.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 460
      },
